      "urpx:hasCoverageClaim": {
        "@id": "jemc:cc-cev-2026-01-01",
        "@type": "urpx:CoverageClaim",
        "urpx:completenessResult": {
          "@id": "urpx:partial"
        },
        "urpx:selfContained": true,
        "urpx:explainedBy": {
          "@type": "urpx:Evaluation",
          "@id": "jemc:cc-cev-2026-01-01-evaluation",
          "urpx:evaluationKind": {
            "@id": "urpx:coverageEvaluation"
          },
          "urpx:description": "This filing does not carry everything its source document states. 4 parts are deferred, listed here in the same words as the filing's tariff.toml [modeling].deferrals so the two records cannot drift. (1) Wholesale Power Cost Adjustment factor. Schedule P-22 increases or decreases every bill by a per-kWh factor the Cooperative computes each month from its estimated purchased-power costs and sales, and publishes no factor. The JSON-LD defines the adjustment as a per-kWh PriceDefinition with no Price, so a modeled bill is high or low by the month's factor times its kWh. (2) Qualified chargers and experimental terms. The schedule serves only the customer's own electric vehicle chargers, for permanent year-round service, and requires documentation of qualified chargers, a dedicated circuit breaker and no more than 1 MW of connected load; availability is case by case, service runs at least twelve consecutive months, and the experimental schedule may be changed or ended on sixty days' notice. The EligibilityRule carries non-residential customer kind and an EV charging distributed energy resource; the other conditions are in its description only. (3) Contribution in aid to construction. Where the Cooperative furnishes additional facilities, the customer pays an upfront non-refundable contribution in aid to construction, which does not count toward any minimum charge. It is not a monthly rate and is not carried. (4) Terms of Payment and Contract Period. The sheet adds a late fee and disconnection charges under the Service Rules and Regulations, makes all charges subject to applicable taxes, and sets a one-year contract. None is priced on the sheet and none is carried.",
          "urpx:evaluatedOn": "2026-10-18T00:00:00"
        }
      }
    }
  }
